1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,440
Kok stiker yang ditempel

2
00:00:01,440 --> 00:00:03,000
di kulit bisa menghasilkan

3
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:04,180
garis seperti ini?

4
00:00:04,720 --> 00:00:07,000
Stiker itu adalah elektroda.

5
00:00:07,480 --> 00:00:08,900
Mereka tidak menyetrum tubuh.

6
00:00:09,080 --> 00:00:11,010
Mereka menangkap perubahan listrik

7
00:00:11,010 --> 00:00:12,980
yang muncul saat jantung bekerja.

8
00:00:13,520 --> 00:00:14,820
Lihat dari dalam.

9
00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:16,790
Sinyal dimulai di nodus sinus,

10
00:00:16,790 --> 00:00:18,420
lalu menyebar ke serambi.

11
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:21,000
Di layar, muncul gelombang P.

12
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:22,820
Sinyal sempat melewati nodus AV,

13
00:00:22,820 --> 00:00:24,560
lalu menyebar cepat ke bilik.

14
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:26,700
Muncullah kompleks QRS.

15
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:28,950
Sesudahnya, bilik berkontraksi.

16
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:30,350
Ketika bilik memulihkan

17
00:00:30,350 --> 00:00:31,540
keadaan listriknya,

18
00:00:31,540 --> 00:00:32,840
muncul gelombang T.

19
00:00:33,440 --> 00:00:35,190
Jadi garis EKG bukan gambar

20
00:00:35,190 --> 00:00:36,610
jantung yang bergerak.

21
00:00:36,610 --> 00:00:38,720
Itu jejak aktivitas listriknya.

22
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:40,680
Dari sini, tenaga kesehatan

23
00:00:40,680 --> 00:00:42,690
bisa menilai laju dan irama jantung,

24
00:00:42,690 --> 00:00:43,970
lalu membacanya bersama

25
00:00:43,970 --> 00:00:44,900
kondisi pasien.

26
00:00:46,420 --> 00:00:48,060
Di MEDCOEL, jelajahi

27
00:00:48,060 --> 00:00:50,220
Atlas 3D dan Live 4D Lab.

28
00:00:50,520 --> 00:00:52,150
Lanjut belajar lewat materi,

29
00:00:52,150 --> 00:00:54,240
latihan soal, dan Simulasi Dokter.

30
00:00:54,560 --> 00:00:56,500
Gratis di medcoel.com.

